# 3. User Roles

## 3.1 User / Attendee

A user can:

- View available events.
- View event details.
- Select an event.
- Request tickets.
- Provide booking information.
- Create a booking when tickets are available.
- Submit contact messages.

---

## 3.2 Admin / Organizer

An administrator or organizer can manage event-related information and booking information according to the implemented administrative capabilities.

